lyric_scrobj_pocake_000^It's a day for kiss…|lyric_scrobj_pocake_001^无论何时都能相遇哦！|lyric_scrobj_pocake_002^说真的呢，我一直都在注意着|lyric_scrobj_pocake_003^悄悄地向这边偷看着|lyric_scrobj_pocake_004^因为我也有相同的感觉|lyric_scrobj_pocake_005^那个时候，距离感也捉摸不定|lyric_scrobj_pocake_006^我们彼此，只是朋友(我们的)当中的一位而已|lyric_scrobj_pocake_007^开始恋爱的契机，|lyric_scrobj_pocake_008^其实是如此简单的事|lyric_scrobj_pocake_009^在目光交汇的那个时刻|lyric_scrobj_pocake_010^告白的时机，准备就绪了吗？|lyric_scrobj_pocake_011^Yes, it's a piece of cake.|lyric_scrobj_pocake_012^因为，你已经让我倾心了|lyric_scrobj_pocake_013^心心相传的这个感受…|lyric_scrobj_pocake_014^简直是心灵感应|lyric_scrobj_pocake_015^就是这样吧　piece of cake.|lyric_scrobj_pocake_016^一瞬间的甜蜜预感不禁让我笑了|lyric_scrobj_pocake_017^要是能够说出「喜欢你」|lyric_scrobj_pocake_018^无论何时一定能成为恋人的…|lyric_scrobj_pocake_019^It's a day for kiss！|lyric_scrobj_pocake_020^无论何时都能相遇哦！|lyric_scrobj_pocake_021^It's a day for kiss！！